NOTE ON SCOPE

The MIT terms above cover the SOFTWARE in this repository: the source code
under mpcr_rag/ and utils/, and the accompanying documentation.

They do not purport to license third-party material, which this repository
does not redistribute:

  * The Manual de Plantas de Costa Rica, published by Missouri Botanical
    Garden Press, is copyrighted by its publisher. No verbatim text from the
    Manual is included here.
  * Geospatial base layers (botanical-region polygons, protected areas, and
    the digital elevation model) remain under the terms of their respective
    sources, cited in the accompanying paper.
  * GBIF occurrence records are governed by the terms of the contributing
    institutions and by the GBIF data-use agreement.

The catalog in data/ contains factual attributes extracted from the Manual
(elevation bounds, slope, botanical regions, forest types, growth form,
phenology, endemism) together with the volume and page at which each entry
appears, so that any value can be traced to its source. It contains no
verbatim prose from the Manual.
